    {
      "id": "el_gzgpx7dn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 432.08533710580423,
      "y": 1138.4857557472994,
      "width": 656.1868896484375,
      "height": 30.83034915589856,
      "text": "Q. What is diff between docker stop and docker kill?",
      "fontSize": 24.664279324718848,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 1947286662,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_sbgtwgp9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 434.21661441951846,
      "y": 1174.2690673094785,
      "width": 818.701171875,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "=> docker stop gracefully shutdown container where docker kill, stops container.\nStop gives grace period for cleanup",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 472270679,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_dq12qyr0",
      "type": "code",
      "x": 441,
      "y": 1241,
      "width": 818,
      "height": 90,
      "code": "docker stop -t 30 my_container",
      "language": "bash",
      "codeTheme": "dark",
      "showLineNumbers": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "seed": 1164079581,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_2ltzriam",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 1368.438941482217,
      "width": 871.064453125,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "STOP  => SIGTERM => waits for grace period => if process is still running => SIGKILL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 1610622119,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_mqyt0l0e",
      "type": "code",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 1522,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 359,
      "code": "# Only CMD\nCMD [\"node\", \"server.js\"]\n# → docker run my-app              runs: node server.js\n# → docker run my-app bash         runs: bash  (CMD replaced!)\n\n# Only ENTRYPOINT\nENTRYPOINT [\"node\"]\n# → docker run my-app              runs: node\n# → docker run my-app server.js    runs: node server.js\n\n# Both together (most common pattern)\nENTRYPOINT [\"node\"]\nCMD [\"server.js\"]\n# → docker run my-app              runs: node server.js\n# → docker run my-app other.js     runs: node other.js  (CMD replaced, ENTRYPOINT fixed)",
      "language": "bash",
      "codeTheme": "dark",
      "showLineNumbers": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "seed": 894251366
    },
    {
      "id": "el_ah6d7v8p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 446,
      "y": 1484.6194643037804,
      "width": 221.62109375,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "CMD vs ENTRYPOINT",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 46219477,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_75w8pzt5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 453.2668768307413,
      "y": 1917.3252184300889,
      "width": 241.9173642583296,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Multi stage build:",
      "fontSize": 27.805969356889605,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 1953246928,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "el_rqa7180m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 451.3264849142381,
      "y": 1970.6857925794907,
      "width": 89.31640625,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Problem:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 492526755,
      "editing": false,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "el_uyfcpvuk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 454.2370542840442,
      "y": 2008.5232684067644,
      "width": 903.642578125,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "When you build a production app, your build process needs a lot of tools:\n\nTypeScript compiler\nWebpack/Vite bundler\nDev dependencies\nBuild tools, compilers, etc.\n\nBut your running app needs almost none of that. It just needs the final compiled output.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 615436968
    },
    {
      "id": "el_7yl72mtu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 454.2370542840442,
      "y": 2237.7311891848767,
      "width": 758.818359375,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Each stage becomes temporary image and final stage becomes main image",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 927740104,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "el_o8ytac0y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 454.7221430106956,
      "y": 2297.883116537091,
      "width": 263.17063150417687,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "ENV vs ARG vs -e",
      "fontSize": 28.62768647796007,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 1887497567,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "el_0bvnegq1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 453.5094026891183,
      "y": 2353.6691713296477,
      "width": 831.611328125,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "ARG => stays during build time only, also can be declared only ex. ARG port. \nDoesn't left footprint inspect command\n\nENV => stays at the build time till container run time. Also needs to be initialized\nex. ENV port=80. Drops footprint in docker inspect <img>\n\n-e => best for secrets that can't be exposed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 847765443,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_sou8h2pk",
      "type": "code",
      "x": 478,
      "y": 2611,
      "width": 531,
      "height": 390,
      "code": "version: '3.8'              # compose file version\n\nservices:                   # your containers\n  frontend:\n    ...\n  backend:\n    ...\n  db:\n    ...\n\nvolumes:                    # named volumes\n  pgdata:\n\nnetworks:                   # custom networks\n  public:\n  private:",
      "language": "bash",
      "codeTheme": "dark",
      "showLineNumbers": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "seed": 374403174,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_x1mjkgak",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 451.9315215958774,
      "y": 2579.25935782581,
      "width": 297.626953125,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Elements of docker-compose:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 1280476186,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "el_3g5k6rq6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 459.2122088324428,
      "y": 3056.143686160634,
      "width": 208.271484375,
      "height": 25,
      "text": "Elements of services:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": "handwritten",
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillColor": "transparent",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "seed": 250934429,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "roughness": 1.5,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_k7x7im2b",
      "type": "code",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3111,
      "width": 655,
      "height": 1085,
      "code": "services:\n  backend:\n    # 1. Image or Build\n    image: node:20-alpine          # use existing image\n    # OR\n    build:\n      context: .                   # where Dockerfile is\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile       # which Dockerfile to use\n      target: production           # which stage in multi-stage\n\n    # 2. Container name\n    container_name: my-backend     # custom name (optional)\n\n    # 3. Ports\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"                # host:container\n      \n      # 4. Environment variables\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3000\n    # OR use .env file\n    env_file:\n      - .env\n\n    # 5. Volumes\n    volumes:\n      - ./src:/app/src             # bind mount\n      - pgdata:/app/data           # named volume\n\n    # 6. Networks\n    networks:\n      - public\n      - private\n      \n      # 7. Dependencies\n    depends_on:\n      db:\n        condition: service_healthy  # wait for db to be healthy\n\n    # 8. Restart policy\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n    # 9. Healthcheck\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:3000/health\"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3",
      "language": "bash",
      "codeTheme": "dark",
      "showLineNumbers": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "seed": 1544776378,
      "editing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "el_4iut8mbv",
      "type": "code",
      "x": 471,
      "y": 4291,
      "width": 645,
      "height": 275,
      "code": "docker compose up\n\ndocker compose down\n# removes containers\n\ndocker compose down -v\n# removes volume\n\ndocker compose start\n\ndocker compose stop",
      "language": "bash",
      "codeTheme": "dark",
      "showLineNumbers": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "seed": 1306921104
    },
